                                                "sense_id": "17f2ad68-062c-3209-9aa5-7968b4c1e1ee",
                                                "text": "3 quindecillion, 657 quattuordecillion, 262 tredecillion; which is to say the figures 3,657,262 followed by 42 ciphers. Operators of the key punch machines transfer a code symbol from the Census …."
                                            },
                                            {
